---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactCard from '../components/ContactCard.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="聯絡" description="與 Yaya 聯絡的方式：Email 與 Instagram。">
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-8">
    <p class="reveal inline-block bg-ink text-cream text-sm font-medium px-3 py-1 mb-6">聯絡我</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-ink mb-4">
      <span data-text-reveal>歡迎跟我說說話</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="reveal text-ink-light text-lg" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
      不管是想聊聊興趣、討論兒少議題，還是有任何想法想跟我分享，都歡迎透過以下方式找我。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
    <ContactCard
      label="Email"
      value="yayalin322@gmail.com"
      href="mailto:yayalin322@gmail.com"
      icon="mail"
    />
    <ContactCard
      label="Instagram"
      value="@yaya.__.lin"
      href="https://www.instagram.com/yaya.__.lin/"
      icon="instagram"
    />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
